@HostAddress = http://localhost:8080
@studentId = 12345678901234567

### 1. Create a class (admin)
POST {{HostAddress}}/classes
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Class 6 - Morning Shift",
  "totalSeats": 120
}

### 2. List all classes with seat accounting
GET {{HostAddress}}/classes
Accept: application/json

### 3. Get a single class's seat status (replace the id)
GET {{HostAddress}}/classes/c_REPLACE_ME
Accept: application/json

### 4. Apply for a seat (hold). Returns 409 when no seats are available.
POST {{HostAddress}}/classes/c_REPLACE_ME/holds
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

### 5. Get a hold's current status (replace the id)
GET {{HostAddress}}/holds/h_REPLACE_ME
Accept: application/json

### 6. Confirm admission (pay fee). Idempotent.
POST {{HostAddress}}/holds/h_REPLACE_ME/confirm
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

### 7. Cancel an application. Returns 204 on success.
DELETE {{HostAddress}}/holds/h_REPLACE_ME
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}

### 8. List the current student's applications
GET {{HostAddress}}/me/holds
X-Student-Id: {{studentId}}
